lowing the tragic passing of founder Amaury Hernández in 2024, the ministry remains committed to preserving and advancing his vision, ministering to thousands through congregational events and ongoing recordings.","type":"text"}]}]}'::jsonb, 'published', id, 1 FROM artists WHERE slug = 'kabed';
